{{/*
  DESIGN-OWNED ARTIFACT — shell.tmpl · package v3.14.0 · WORKFLOW.md v4 · map #22 (LAST)
  Source of truth: examples/console/ConsoleApp.jsx + components TopNav/OrgSwitcher/CommandPalette/
  ToastStack/Toast/Footer/Logo/Avatar/Kbd. Replaces templates_shell.go's "head" + "chrome" +
  "foot" AND pageCSS wholesale (P4.4: the shell glue and legacy page classes are removed with the
  conversion — every screen is design-owned now; the repo-authored "scantrigger" define must be
  restyled inline by Wayfinder within the token vocabulary, it may no longer lean on pageCSS).
  Reconciliations (SPEC-CHANGE #27, ruled):
  #27a head — contract kept: .Title, .Refresh, the localStorage("verge-theme") → data-theme boot
    script. pageCSS dies; the head inlines the font @import + designTokens() (the design token
    set now serves EVERY page) + the design shell CSS below. The .DesignTokens gate and the
    data-design-shell resets retire — nothing is left to isolate.
  #27b chrome — the spec TopNav: pulse-glyph wordmark, OrgSwitcher (nullable .Orgs — a single-org
    deployment renders the static chip; org switching needs an org store: alias or BUILD
    POST /org/switch, SPEC-CHANGE escalate if orgs are not modeled), nav pills with counts, scan
    status, ⌘K search button, inbox bell popover (top 4 messages + All messages → /inbox),
    version, theme toggle, GitHub, account menu (Avatar initials; Profile · Settings · palette
    hint · sign-out form — keep the existing sign-out action verbatim).
  #27c palette — the repo scaffold CONTRACT is kept (#315: ids #cmdk/.cmdk-input/.cmdk-item/
    .cmdk-group, the [data-cmdk-search] overflow item whose href tracks the query to /search?q=,
    integrationsEnabled gating) rendered as the spec panel; groups are server-rendered from
    .Chrome.PaletteGroups (items are links; the theme item is the one JS action).
  #27d toasts — the spec ToastStack renders .Chrome.Toasts (the PRG flash store): tone dot,
    title/description, dismiss, 5s auto-dismiss with the leave animation.
  #27e foot — the spec console Footer gated by .Chrome; the scroll-preservation JS was kept
    byte-for-byte (behavior contract). SUPERSEDED by ADR-0130 (#970): the restore now keys on
    the full URL and gates on navigation type. The byte-for-byte freeze no longer holds; the
    block comment above the script states the current contract.
  #27f goldens — with the chrome converted the harness stops cropping to <main>: ALL landed
    screens re-render FULL-PAGE goldens in the canonical container — the one-time regen,
    version-bumped here.
  #33 (ruled 2026-08-26): OrgSwitcher retires permanently — single-org stands per ADR-0073; the static
  org chip is the only rendering; .Chrome.Orgs and the /org/switch route never ship; org-open state drops.
  Holes: .Title .Refresh, and .Chrome (nullable — auth surfaces pass none):
  .Chrome{Nav[{ID,Label,Href,Active,Count}], Org,
  Version, UserName, UserInitials, ScanRunning, Unread, Messages[{ID,Class,Rel,Headline,Unread,
  Href}], PaletteGroups[{Label,Items[{Label,Icon,Hint,Href,Search,ThemeToggle}]}],
  Toasts[{Tone,Title,Description}]}.
*/}}
{{define "head"}}<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem("verge-theme");if(t){document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme",t);}}catch(e){}</script>
<title>{{.Title}} · Verge ASM</title>{{if .Refresh}}<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="6">{{end}}<style>
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400..700&display=swap");
</style><style data-design-tokens>{{designTokens}}</style><style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; scrollbar-gutter: stable; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg-page); color: var(--text-body); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
body > main, body > .vg-center { flex: 1 0 auto; }
a { color: var(--link); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
@keyframes sh-pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }
@keyframes sh-fade { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes sh-pulse { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(3, 122, 192, 0.35); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(3, 122, 192, 0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(3, 122, 192, 0); } }
@keyframes sh-toast-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes sh-toast-out { from { opacity: 1; transform: none; } to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } }
.sh-topnav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; height: 56px; padding: 0 24px; background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30; font-family: var(--font-ui); }
.sh-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; flex: none; text-decoration: none; }
.sh-brand:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.sh-brand .wm { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px; }
.sh-brand .w1 { font: 650 17px var(--font-ui); letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--text-ink); line-height: 1; }
.sh-brand .w2 { font: 600 9px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--accent); }
.sh-pop { position: relative; display: inline-flex; flex: none; }
.sh-pop > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; }
.sh-pop > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.sh-orgchip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 24px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); font: 500 11.5px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-secondary); flex: none; white-space: nowrap; }
.sh-panel { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); z-index: 95; background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); padding: 5px; animation: sh-pop var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); }
.sh-panel.left { left: 0; }
.sh-panel.right { right: 0; }
.sh-micro { font: 500 10.5px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
.sh-panel > .sh-micro { display: block; padding: 6px 10px 4px; }
.sh-pills { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-left: 8px; }
.sh-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 999px; font: 500 13px var(--font-ui); color: var(--text-secondary); background: transparent; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out), color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); }
.sh-pill:hover { color: var(--text-body); background: var(--surface-sunken); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-pill.on { color: var(--link); background: var(--accent-soft); font-weight: 600; }
.sh-pill .ct { font: 600 10.5px var(--font-mono); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-sunken); color: var(--text-secondary); }
.sh-pill.on .ct { background: var(--surface); }
.sh-actions { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; flex: none; }
.sh-scan { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 26px; padding: 0 11px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--accent-border, var(--accent)); background: var(--accent-soft); font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
.sh-scan:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-scan:hover .d { background: var(--on-accent); }
.sh-scan .d { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); animation: sh-pulse 1.8s var(--ease-out) infinite; }
.sh-iconbtn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--text-secondary); cursor: pointer; padding: 0; transition: background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out), color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); }
.sh-iconbtn:hover { background: var(--surface-sunken); color: var(--text-body); }
.sh-bell { position: relative; display: inline-flex; }
.sh-bell .ud { position: absolute; top: 4px; right: 4px; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--surface); }
.sh-msgs { width: 340px; max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 8px 6px 6px; }
.sh-msgrow { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; width: 100%; padding: 10px 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-body); transition: background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); }
.sh-msgrow + .sh-msgrow { border-top: 1px solid var(--row-sep); }
.sh-msgrow:hover { background: var(--surface-sunken); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-msgrow .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; margin-top: 5px; flex: none; background: transparent; }
.sh-msgrow.unread .dot { background: var(--accent); }
.sh-msgrow .bd { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.sh-msgrow .top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.sh-msgrow .cls { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 20px; padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); color: var(--text-secondary); font: 400 11px var(--font-mono); white-space: nowrap; }
.sh-msgrow .when { margin-left: auto; font: 400 11px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; }
.sh-msgrow .tx { font: 400 12.5px/1.5 var(--font-ui); color: var(--text-body); }
.sh-msgrow.unread .tx { font-weight: 500; }
.sh-msgall { display: block; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--row-sep); background: transparent; padding: 9px 8px 4px; font: 500 12px var(--font-ui); color: var(--link); cursor: pointer; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 2px; }
.sh-msgall:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.sh-ver { font: 400 11px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
.sh-gh { font: 500 12px var(--font-ui); color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-gh:hover { color: var(--text-body); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-avatar { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); font: 600 11px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform: uppercase; }
.sh-acct { min-width: 210px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.sh-mi { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; width: 100%; height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; color: var(--text-body); font: 500 12.5px var(--font-ui); text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; transition: background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); }
.sh-mi:hover { background: var(--surface-sunken); text-decoration: none; }
.sh-mi .mic { display: inline-flex; color: var(--text-secondary); flex: none; }
.sh-mi .hint { margin-left: auto; font: 400 11px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
.sh-sep { height: 1px; background: var(--row-sep); margin: 5px 4px; }
.sh-kbd { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 18px; height: 18px; padding: 0 5px; background: var(--surface-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-bottom-width: 2px; border-radius: 5px; font: 500 10.5px var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-secondary); }
#cmdk { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 120; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 10vh 16px 16px; }
#cmdk[hidden] { display: none; }
.cmdk-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(21,18,15,0.4); animation: sh-fade var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); border: none; padding: 0; cursor: default; }
.cmdk-panel { position: relative; width: min(560px, 100%); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); overflow: hidden; animation: sh-pop var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); font-family: var(--font-ui); }
.cmdk-inputrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 0 16px; height: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--row-sep); }
.cmdk-inputrow .ic { display: inline-flex; color: var(--text-muted); flex: none; }
.cmdk-input { flex: 1; border: none; outline: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text-ink); font: 400 13px var(--font-mono); }
.cmdk-list { max-height: 320px; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; padding: 6px; }
.cmdk-group .glabel { padding: 8px 10px 4px; font: 500 10.5px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
.cmdk-group[hidden] { display: none; }
.cmdk-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border: none; border-radius: 10px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; color: var(--text-body); font: 500 13px var(--font-ui); text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; }
